<Layout title="Privacy" description="How this small static site handles visitor data and external services."><article class="article"><p class="eyebrow">Last updated November 4, 2026</p><h1>A small site.<br />A short privacy note.</h1><p>This version of J Sol has no accounts, purchase checkout, signup forms, advertising scripts or visitor analytics added by the site code.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The site is served through Cloudflare. Hosting and security infrastructure may process connection information such as IP addresses and request details to deliver and protect the site. This is not a promise that no data is processed.</p><h2>Previous StocksWatch services</h2><p>The former NBIS newsletter and payment services are not connected to this site's new content. Removing their forms from the website does not delete an existing subscription, purchase record or third-party account. Existing newsletter subscribers can use the unsubscribe option in their newsletter emails.</p><h2>Links and recommendations</h2><p>Other websites apply their own privacy terms when you visit them. The links hub includes a personal HSA Store referral. Jacob may receive loyalty points from qualifying purchases through that link; the benefit is disclosed beside it. External services and shortened links may process clicks under their own policies. Future affiliate links or paid partnerships will be labeled individually. The site does not add click tracking or tracking parameters.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>This page will be updated if the site introduces a feature that changes its data handling.</p></article></Layout>
